# Teaching Keynes's Principle of Effective Demand Using the Aggregate Labor Market Diagram.

**Authors:** Dalziel, Paul, Lavoie, Marc

## Abstract
Suggests a method to teach John Keynes's principle of effective demand using a standard aggregate labor market diagram familiar to students taking advanced undergraduate macroeconomics courses. States the analysis incorporates Michal Kalecki's version to show Keynesian unemployment as a point on the aggregate labor demand curve inside the aggregate labor supply curve. (JEH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ679991

